@startuml
!include ../theme.puml
title L2 认知运行层组件图
top to bottom direction
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 90
skinparam ranksep 100

rectangle "L1 ReAct业务适配 / Activity" as L1 LC_EXTERNAL
package "L2 Cognitive Runtime" LC_KERNEL {
  component "AgentRuntime / AgentLoop" as LOOP
  component "ParserNormalizer" as PARSER
  component "AgentAdapter Boundary" as ADAPTER_BOUNDARY
  component "PiAgentAdapter" as PI
  package "Pi 核心库（进程内依赖）" {
    component "ModelRuntime / Models\nstreamSimple" as SDK
    component "Provider 编码与流解码" as CODEC
  }
}
rectangle "共享 PiContextAdapter\n基础设施适配" as CTX LC_INFRASTRUCTURE
rectangle "Model Provider" as MODEL LC_EXTERNAL
rectangle "Operations Plane" as OPS LC_OPERATIONS

L1 --> LOOP : BND-L12-001\nRuntimeControlPort
LOOP --> ADAPTER_BOUNDARY : AgentAdapterPort
ADAPTER_BOUNDARY --> PI : Adapter 私有映射
PI --> CTX : CTX-CON-1\n同版输入转换
PI --> SDK : 私有 ModelInvocationClient\n受控 Egress 内调用
SDK --> CODEC : Pi Provider API
CODEC --> MODEL : BND-MOD-001\n受控模型出口
PI --> PARSER : 规范化事件与完整候选
PARSER ..> LOOP : 已校验 RuntimeEvent
LOOP ..> L1 : RuntimeEventPort\nToolCallCandidate / Progress
LOOP ..> OPS : BND-OPS-001

note bottom of PARSER
  Provider 私有解析留在 Adapter；
  本组件只校验规范化事件。
end note
note bottom of SDK
  单轮调用；自动推理重试0。
  不启动原生agentLoop或工具执行器。
  原生队列限额/参数证据仍待闭合。
end note
@enduml
